            <ArticleTitle>Calling for a rapid recognition and response program for stroke in China.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this article, we provide evidences indicating that a a rapid recognition and response program based on FAST (face, Arm, Speech, Time) for stroke suitable for China is desperately needed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
